{"pageid":278,"title":"Snowball","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Snowball</span>","revid":21306,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Snowball</b> is a previously unreleased tool that was first featured in the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UzDP_6s95GQ\">first Oaklands trailer</a>. For 5 days before Christmas, the testing place map was covered in snow, and playtesters could find little lumps on the ground, that when interacted, would yield a <b>Snowball</b>. It did not have any functionality. However, during the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Events\">2024 Christmas Event</a>, it came back in the form of berries that grew on bushes. It could be sold for 125 snowflakes or be grabbed and moved as an item. It remains in the <a href=\"/wiki/Snowlands\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Snowlands\">Snowy Peaks/Snowlands</a> region.\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Snowball</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/04/Snowball.png/revision/latest?cb=20230720034246\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Snowball\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/04/Snowball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230720034246\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/04/Snowball.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230720034246 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/04/Snowball.png/revision/latest?cb=20230720034246 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Snowball\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Snowball.png\" data-image-name=\"Snowball.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">N/A</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Free</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tool / Sellable for snowflakes</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" d